Source of the legal text

The text of the acts in this repository is the consolidated text (Legislação Consolidada) of the Diário da República,
the official journal of the Portuguese Republic, published at https://diariodarepublica.pt by the Imprensa
Nacional-Casa da Moeda, S.A. (INCM). Source: Diário da República, INCM, https://diariodarepublica.pt.

The DR's legal notice (Avisos Legais, https://diariodarepublica.pt/dr/geral/avisos-legais, read on 2026-10-28) says
that the public service of universal and free access to the Diário da República (Decreto-Lei n.º 83/2016) "compreende
a possibilidade de impressão, arquivo, pesquisa e livre acesso ao conteúdo dos atos publicados nas 1.ª e 2.ª séries
do Diário da República" (includes printing, archiving, searching and free access to the content of the acts
published in the 1st and 2nd series), and that the INCM produces "o texto consolidado dos atos publicados, ainda que
sem valor legal" (the consolidated text of published acts, though without legal value). The notice forbids only
attempts to alter or upload information, or any action that could harm the system; it states no other condition
on reuse. Under the Portuguese Copyright Code (Código do Direito de Autor e dos Direitos Conexos, artigo 8.º),
official texts such as laws do not benefit from copyright protection. The site's footer reads "INCM, SA - todos os
direitos reservados".

The consolidated texts have no legal value. Only the Diário da República as published is authoritative.

Everything else in this repository (the history as commits, the commit messages, the tables and the tools) is
dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

